# copyrighted book text, page images and rendered crops never enter git
book/
**/images/
**/pages/
**/crops/
**/evidence*/
*.pdf
# ...but the skill repo's own packages are CODE, not campaign data: the patterns
# above are written for a campaign directory, and `book/` would otherwise hide
# scripts/book/ (the Stage 1 package) from git entirely.
!scripts/book/

# run state and caches
runs/*/tend-root/
detect/*/deps.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
